{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kero Quest 64 is a <i>Collectathon 3D Platformer</i> inspired by other games in the genre, especially those from the late 90s. You take control of Kero, a blue frog seeking to stop a prince from abusing his newly gained powers by collecting Magical Shards around the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/6dc415c18b82627a2b96ef452fda7e53.poster.avif?t=1758652841\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/6dc415c18b82627a2b96ef452fda7e53.webm?t=1758652841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/6dc415c18b82627a2b96ef452fda7e53.mp4?t=1758652841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Big World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you must find your way through <strong>20+ Open Levels</strong>, each with its own retro 3D aesthetic. On your quest to gain Magical Shards, you will collect various things such as <strong>Gold Coins</strong> and <strong>Costumes</strong> for Kero to wear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/39ad0566e6f0f4ccccd397f6cced8731.poster.avif?t=1758652841\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/39ad0566e6f0f4ccccd397f6cced8731.webm?t=1758652841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/39ad0566e6f0f4ccccd397f6cced8731.mp4?t=1758652841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with some advanced movement options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, light-hearted story that can be enjoyed by anyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics inspired by the late 90s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 levels to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of things to collect in every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional content such as costumes to unlock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/d73e957274084ee1a9d5c6da94e2ba86.poster.avif?t=1758652841\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/d73e957274084ee1a9d5c6da94e2ba86.webm?t=1758652841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/extras/d73e957274084ee1a9d5c6da94e2ba86.mp4?t=1758652841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411900?t=1758652841","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758652841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/5f016bd9da23394c307428e1d98cb1610c4e81f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758652841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411900/5f016bd9da23394c307428e1d98cb1610c4e81f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758652841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comf